From fe52c0961dcb4f87fdbfad67656e417f4b1cd494 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jraphaelsst <joaoraphaelsst@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 16 Jul 2026 18:54:23 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(seed): add n8n Protocol+Fake+Real adapter, refactor
 mcp/n8n to consume it
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Leg A — seed/lib/backend/noctusai_lib/integrations/n8n/ (mailchimp shape,
Protocol+Fake+Real+factory) covers list/get/activate/deactivate/rename/
delete workflows, execution list/get, tag list/create/set, and the
webhook-only run_via_webhook — the only sanctioned dispatch path (n8n's
public API has no execute endpoint). Encodes the facts measured live
2026-07-16: full workflow objects (incl. nodes) on GET /workflows so
can_run is computable with no N+1 but the Workflow value object never
retains nodes; isArchived excluded by default; the browser User-Agent
required by the Cloudflare WAF on both API and webhook calls; the
PUT-sanitize allowlist; tag-ids-not-names; int execution ids vs str
workflow ids. 94 new seed tests (mappers/fake/httpx-MockTransport).

Leg B — mcp/n8n/api.py's normalize_base_url now delegates to the seed's
canonical copy instead of an independent reimplementation (the fork this
slice exists to prevent); mcp/n8n/tools/workflow.py's PUT-sanitize
allowlist and tag-ids body-shape now import the same seed mappers
HttpxN8nClient uses. The 16 tools' external contract, api.request_json's
sync urllib seam, and every mcp/n8n/tests/* file are unchanged — all 32
pass unedited.

Fix-on-contact: httpx was imported by ~10 seed modules but undeclared in
seed/lib/backend/pyproject.toml; declared explicitly.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
